": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-28T19:34:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115527763767500836"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/DIH1C2fRaR", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2115527763767500836/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115527761582325761", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/DIH1C2fRaR"}]}, "id": "2115527763767500836", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 55, "impression_count": 33177, "like_count": 185, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "ASE showcased its panel-level packaging (PLP) solution for AMD’s Venice CPU, with initial production targeted for Q1 2027, likely at limited scale at its Kaohsiung facility. ASE and its subsidiary SPIL have worked with AMD to implement the second generation of their Fan-Out https://t.co/DIH1C2fRaR", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2115527763767500836"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:17:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115508291572781200"], "id": "2115508291572781200", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 21606, "like_count": 149, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "I feel a little bad ranting at Gemini about the unreleased model, as going through the unofficial channels to get a frontier model out today I hear is a good bit of a mess and definitely not easy. That's why they say patience is a virtue.", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2115508291572781200"}, {"author_id": "778764142412984320", "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:13:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115507199623803084"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Gradio/status/…", "end": 63, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Gradio/status/2115182881828229517", "start": 40, "url": "https://t.co/Kf3rXl7eOB"}]}, "id": "2115507199623803084", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 717, "impression_count": 64240, "like_count": 970, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 